description:
Unleashes a traveling Psionic Orb that deals {damage} damage per second to all enemies along its path.

Travel distance: {distance}.

{stacks}

Deals {damage} damage to target enemy unit.
Can target ground and air units.

{stacks}

Sacrifices a Supplicant to fully restore the Ascendant's energy.
Can only target Supplicants.

{bonus}

Makes the target unit float in the air, disabling its abilities. Effect lasts up to 10 seconds.
Massive units are immune.

{targets}

Calls down a Tactical Missile Strike at a target location. Tactical Missiles take 4 seconds to land, but they deal up to 150 (+100 vs. structures) damage to enemies in a small radius. (100% damage within 1.5 range of the hit, 50% from 1.5 to 2.0 range)
Cooldown is time to build one missile.

{channel}

Heals a friendly biological target.
Heals 9 life per 3 energy.

{targets}

Deals 200 damage to target enemy ground or air unit from long range (10).
Can target biological and mechanical units.

{refund}

Heals nearby biological and mechanical units. Lasts for 30 seconds.

Restores {healing} life per second to each target.

{cloak}

Deals 170 damage to target enemy biological unit.
Mechanical units are immune.

{shots}

Heals a friendly {targets} target.
Heals {healing} life per 3 energy per second.

{protection}

Cloaks the unit, preventing enemy units from seeing or attacking it. A cloaked unit will only be revealed by detectors or effects.
Drains 0.9 energy per second.

{evasion}

Marks a target unit, dealing {damage} damage after 5 seconds. Holds up to 3 charges.

{restraint}

{recharge}

Deploy an automated defensive turret. Turrets gain the same gear bonuses as Sirius himself. Times out after 60 seconds. Holds up to 5 charges.
Can attack ground and air units.

{frame}

{missiles}

{fear}

{explosion}

Douses enemy ground units in oil, reducing attack and movement speed by 75% and preventing them from cloaking. When a unit under the effect of Oil Spill is hit by a fire attack, it takes 5 ({lightDamage} vs Light) damage per second over 10 seconds.

Radius: {radius}.

{spread}

Fires pulses of ultrasonic energy that lasts {duration} seconds, causing {damage} damage per second to enemy units in the target area. Does not damage friendly units. Holds up to 3 charges.

Radius: {radius}.

{network}

Temporarily take control of target enemy unit and increases its damage by 50%. Dominated units self-destruct after {duration} seconds. Holds up to 3 charges.

